# Local-run files: .dev.vars holds the Recurly sandbox PRIVATE key. Every file
# in this folder is served publicly, and a hand `wrangler deploy` uploads the
# folder as it is on disk, so without these two lines a local test would
# publish that key on leskobusiness.com.
.dev.vars
.dev.vars.example

